1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,530
Why did the police have to push Jumbo off the main street?
警察为什么要把江伯推离大街？

2
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:20,020
Why did the police have to push Jumbo off the main street?
警察为什么要把江伯推离大街？

3
00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:25,500
Last Christmas, the circus owner,
去年圣诞节，马戏团老板

4
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:30,860
Jimmy Gates, decided to take some presents to a children's hospital.
吉米·盖茨决定给一家儿童医院送些礼物。

5
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:39,510
Dressed up as Father Christmas and accompanied by a 'guard of honour' of six pretty girls,
他打扮成圣诞老人，由六位漂亮姑娘组成的“仪仗队”陪同，

6
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:45,750
he set off down the main street of the city riding a baby elephant called Jumbo.
骑着一头叫江伯的小象沿城市的大街出发了。

7
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:51,960
He should have known that the police would never allow this sort of thing.
他本该知道警察决不会允许这种事。

8
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:56,570
A policeman approached Jimmy and told him
一名警察走到吉米面前告诉他，

9
00:00:56,590 --> 00:01:01,930
he ought to have gone along a side street as Jumbo was holding up the traffic.
他本该走小街，因为江伯阻碍了交通。

10
00:01:03,470 --> 00:01:09,000
Though Jimmy agreed to go at once, Jumbo refused to move.
虽然吉米同意马上走，江伯却拒绝挪动。

11
00:01:09,990 --> 00:01:15,940
Fifteen policemen had to push very hard to get him off the main street.
十五名警察不得不使劲推，才把它推离大街。

12
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:21,650
The police had a difficult time, but they were most amused.
警察费了很大劲，但他们觉得非常好笑。

13
00:01:23,550 --> 00:01:28,120
'Jumbo must weigh a few tons,' said a policeman afterwards,
“江伯一定有好几吨重，”一个警察后来说，

14
00:01:28,990 --> 00:01:32,240
'so it was fortunate that we didn't have to carry him.
“所以幸好我们不必抬它。

15
00:01:32,690 --> 00:01:35,660
Of course, we should arrest him,
当然，我们应该逮捕它，

16
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:39,760
but as he has a good record, we shall let him off this time.'
不过它一向表现良好，这次就饶了它。”
